{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21934","headline":"初授拾遗 · 白居易","name":"初授拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奉诏登左掖，束带参朝议。\n何言初命卑，且脱风尘吏。\n杜甫陈子昂，才名括天地。\n当时非不遇，尚无过斯位。\n况余蹇薄者，宠至不自意。\n惊近白日光，慙非青云器。\n天子方从谏，朝廷无忌讳。\n岂不思匪躬，适遇时无事。\n受命已旬月，饱食随班次。\n谏纸忽盈箱，对之终自媿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}